  If this toolkit supports your research, testing, localization, accessibility,
  or software engineering work, please cite the project using this metadata.
title: Rawafid Arabic/RTL Accessibility & Localization Toolkit
type: software
authors:
  - name: Rawafid contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/khaledaltheeb/rawafid-arabic-rtl-a11y-toolkit
url: https://healthrenewal.org/
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A framework-agnostic TypeScript toolkit for Arabic and bidirectional web
  interfaces, localization, accessibility interactions, Unicode-safe text,
  direction-aware UI behavior, and real-browser verification.
keywords:
